nt/tests/withdraw.rs:468 now defines deploy_suite_for_protocol; the caller is outside the assigned lockfile repair. Row 45 builds the qualification binary successfully and enters bounded-fuzz, then rustup attempts to provision the absent pinned nightly. The owned subprocess was terminated to honor the no-compiler-installation constraint. Verbatim final failure: Terminated; make[1]: *** [Makefile:2138: agent-fuzz-all] Error 143; make: *** [Makefile:2306: agent-qualify-fuzz] Error 1. Before termination the subprocess downloaded components and logged installation of cargo, clippy and rust-docs; full toolchain installation and fuzz execution are not established. qual-logs/r15/fuzz-toolchain-stop.log records the intervention; row-45.log retains the complete failure envelope. This is an interrupted prerequisite attempt, not a fuzz pass."
