observed = "formerly observation.6.8.35. formerly observation.6.8.34. The exact make platform-hosted-topology-check platform-beta-cluster-up platform-hosted-smoke platform-beta-cluster-down gate exits 2. All seventeen images build and load, both kind nodes become Ready, and deployment, permissions, genesis activation and both guarantor bonds complete. Forge finalization fails during an account read after the Paxeer boundary resets a connection and kubectl loses its shared forward. The Paxeer pod remains 4/4 ready with no restarts. A real read-only TLS-close probe completes 277 of 1000 requests before EOF, reset and connection-refused failures; an earlier probe without orderly TLS shutdown completes 1000 of 1000. Logs: qual-logs/au39/task-6.8-first.log, task-6.8-first.exit, tls-close-probe-before.log and tls-probe-live.log."
assumption = "The boundary sent close_notify then immediately dropped TCP without draining the client shutdown bytes. The repair half-closes the write side and drains only transport bytes, with a one-second deadline and the existing header-byte bound. No additional HTTP request is executed. Existing admission, framing, TLS, body, response and connection-count limits remain unchanged. No signed transaction or Forge broadcast is automatically retried."

[observation.6.8.66]
task = "6.8"
