observed = "Real custody CREDIT at global sequence 1 consumes identity sequence 0 while the newly credited beneficiary ledger account retains next_sequence 0. Mandatory batch maintenance occupies global sequence 2. WITHDRAW envelope sequence 1 passes identity admission but withdrawal_context copies it to the ledger actor_sequence, producing LXP_ERR_SEQUENCE_GAP (-300) at global sequence 3. Envelope sequence 0 instead fails identity admission with LXP_ERR_SEQUENCE_REUSED (-301). Canonical receipt decoding and daemon diagnostics are in qual-logs/set1/e-daemon-sequence-counters.log. The existing native module mode-5 assertion requires refusal of envelope sequence 1 against ledger sequence 0. Neither that assertion nor the conflicting module implementation was changed."
