[observation.6.8.21]
task = "6.8"
severity = "note"
file = "platform/hosted/node/bootstrap.sh platform/hosted/node/Dockerfile platform/hosted/node/tests/bootstrap-test.py platform/hosted/node/tests/node-test.sh platform/hosted/tests/beta-cluster.sh"
symbol = "paxeer_contracts_deploy LXP_GENESIS_MAX_GUARANTORS"
observed = "formerly observation.6.8.20. The node bootstrap reads finality_policy.certificate_threshold from the settlement document, generates that many real secp256k1 keys within the genesis builder limit of 32, sorts the LXGB entries and indexed node.env exports by guarantor id, and preserves the first generated key as the node key. The exact request assertion is 314 + 81 * count bytes. The deployment generator consumes every exported member, creates distinct controller keys and passes all members to the existing per-controller funding and approval loops. The node image includes jq and the same settlement document. Real bootstrap tests with /root/lx-lanes/native-bin pass for counts 1, 2, 3 and 32, verify every encoded id and public key against generated keys and owner-only permissions, and reject zero, negative, oversized, fractional, string, null and boolean thresholds before generation. make test-genesis and bash -n on both scripts and node-test.sh exit 0. Logs: qual-logs/au36/bootstrap-final.log, genesis-test.log and bash-n.log."
assumption = "Focused tests ran against the complete generator working tree before commit d97c3c01 and its required rebase to 65170facf792970bedf218e3c3c3f509a2bdd386. The rebase left all five changed source files byte-identical; these focused results do not establish full cluster qualification. The certificate threshold, settlement refusal and vectors domain are unchanged. ShellCheck is unavailable. make platform-test-node exits 2 after its real layerxctl test passes because the probe build refuses an existing Cargo.lock mismatch under --locked; node integration is not qualified. qual-logs/au36/node-test.log records the blocker. Codify review times out with exit 124; guard exits 0 with an advisory about the unrelated active task 3.7 scope. No task status or declared scope was changed."

